flowchart LR
    U[User or QA analyst] --> UI[Streamlit UI]
    UI --> H[HTML input or synthetic sample page]
    H --> P[Planner Orchestrator\nSelect supported checks]
    P --> S[Scanner Agent\nDetect supported HTML signals]
    S --> A[Standards Analyst\nMap findings to WCAG 2.2]
    A --> F[Fix Recommendation Agent\nProvide implementation guidance]
    F --> V[Validation Agent\nState automated boundary]
    V --> C[Critic Agent\nCheck hand-off completeness]
    C --> R[Severity report\nCSV export and human checklist]
    W[WCAG rule knowledge] -. supports .-> A
    V -. requires .-> HR[Human keyboard and screen-reader review]
